### Update an existing score
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripId": "{{tripId}}",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "roundNumber": 1,
  "grossTotal": 75,
  "netTotal": 75,
  "isComplete": true
}

### Delete a score
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/scores/{{scoreId}}
